<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 3, and should be effective for both the <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=85804/selfless-healer">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_gaurdedbythelight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Selfless Healer</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=114163/eternal-flame">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_torch_thrown.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Flame</span></a> playstyles, though this example is set up for the former. Consult the Stat Priority Guide as well as the Gemming section below for more information on how to optimize reforging and item enhancements for Eternal Flame. Also of note is the Wrist item <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96408/armplates-of-the-vanquished-abomination">
<img alt="Armplates of the Vanquished Abomination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidpaladin_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armplates of the Vanquished Abomination</span></a> which can drop with various secondary stats; on paper Mastery is best for Selfless Healer, and Critical Strike is better for Eternal Flame, though in practice Mastery is generally superior for both specs due to the overhealing inherent to Critical Strikes.<br/>
